    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n18199" root="زنبر" body-key="z">
    
      Q. 2 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَزَنْبَرَ عَلَيْنَا</span></b>  <i>He behaved proudly,</i> or
<i>haughtily, to us,</i> (K, * TA,) <i>and frowned,</i> or
<i>looked sternly, austerely,</i> or <i>morosely.</i> (TA.)


